WEBVTT

00:13:58.978 --> 00:14:01.560
that's just where
the technology is right now.

00:14:01.584 --> 00:14:03.322
As the technology evolves,

00:14:03.346 --> 00:14:06.330
as you get full immersive
displays and whatnot,

00:14:06.354 --> 00:14:09.124
this sort of thing
will only grow; it will adapt.

00:14:09.148 --> 00:14:14.701
It will adapt to its environment;
it's a durable mutation.

00:14:14.725 --> 00:14:15.890
Here's another one.

00:14:15.914 --> 00:14:18.211
This is by Drew Weing; this is called

00:14:18.235 --> 00:14:21.250
"'Pup' Ponders the Heat Death
of the Universe."